# Implementation Plan - Phase 8: Mobile Foundation & Authentication

This phase establishes the mobile application shell using Flutter. It implements the Feature-Based Clean Architecture, Dependency Injection (using GetIt), Repository Patterns, a Client-side Event Bus, persistent dark-mode-first glassmorphism styling, and the complete login and profile setup flow.

