### Manual Verification
1. Boot the backend server Docker containers.
2. Launch the Flutter mobile application in a simulator/emulator.
3. Test OTP request with invalid CAPTCHA, then valid CAPTCHA.
4. Verify with default testing code `12345`.
5. Complete Rules acceptance and setup profile. Check that mobile number is read-only.
6. Verify access to the Main Hub navigation.
